<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insĭtīvus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>ingrafted</i>, <i>grafted</i> (<b>poet.</b> and post - Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 2, 19</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>substituted</i>, <i>spurious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">liberi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 3, 3, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">heres,</span>”
				<i>adopted</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 2, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alimentum lactis,</span>”
				<i>of another person than the mother</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 12, 1, 17</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur. n.</i> as <i>subst.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insitiva virtutum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Ep. 2, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
